1. 总体架构目标
============================================================

当前环境主动作已经是 final waypoint。现在需要把 env.step 内部执行逻辑改成：

Policy
  outputs env_action = final waypoint [B,N,2]
    ↓
WaypointMultiUAVEnv.step(actions: dict[str, waypoint])
    ↓
SafetyLayer
  validates / clips / rejects final waypoints
    ↓
ActionAdapter
  converts waypoint command into low-level control
    ↓
DynamicsBackend
  executes continuous particle dynamics
    ↓
Scenario
  updates task state and computes reward / metrics

默认组合必须是：

