6. 新增 DynamicsBackend 抽象
============================================================

新增统一接口：

class DynamicsBackend:
    def reset(self, world): ...
    def step(self, world, controls, adapter_output=None, safety_result=None) -> DynamicsInfo: ...

DynamicsBackend 负责：

- 连续动力学积分
- velocity update
- position update
- damping
- mass
- max speed clipping
- collision/contact force
- disturbance / wind / action noise
- geofence / no-fly hard handling
- min inter-UAV distance or collision handling
- path length update
- trajectory update
- communication graph update
- coverage footprint update

定义统一输出结构：

@dataclass
class DynamicsInfo:
    path_length_delta: np.ndarray     # [N]
    arrived_mask: np.ndarray          # [N]
    rejected_mask: np.ndarray         # [N]
    safety_violation_count: int
    min_pairwise_distance: float
    collision_count: int
    no_fly_violation_count: int
    geofence_violation_count: int
    mean_speed: float
    max_speed_observed: float
    mean_control_norm: float
    disturbance_norm: float
    substeps: int
    info: dict

如果项目里已有 transition_info 字段，请保持兼容。scenario.compute_rewards 依赖的字段不能丢。

